User Roles

=Job Seekers (Candidates)

Sign up, log in, and manage profiles
Search for jobs based on filters (location, category, experience, salary, etc.)
Apply for jobs and track applications
Upload resumes and profile images
Save favorite job listings
Receive job alerts & notifications

=Employers

Register, log in, and manage company profiles
Post job listings with details (title, description, salary, requirements, etc.)
View job applications and contact candidates
Shortlist applicants and schedule interviews

=Admin

Manage all users (job seekers & employers)
Approve or reject employer accounts
Monitor job postings and applications
View analytics and reports (e.g., number of jobs posted, applications received)
Handle reported job listings and spam prevention





