API Routes
Public APIs (/api/public)

-Auth (/auth)
POST /register → Register job seeker/employer(user)
POST /login → Login user
POST /forgot-password → Password recovery
POST /reset-password → Reset password


-------------------------------------------------------------------

-User Profile (/user)

GET /profile → Get user profile
PUT /update-profile → Update user details
(POST /upload-resume → Upload job seeker's resume)

-Jobs (/jobs)
GET /jobs → Get all job listings(view jobs)
GET /jobs/:id → Get details of a specific job(view One jobs)
POST /apply → Apply for a job

